  "semantic_hazards": [
    "The mainnet descriptor binds all six formats to the implementation address even though both official deployment records and three fixed-block RPC providers identify the proxy as LockedGold/LockedCelo.",
    "Calling a proxy implementation directly executes against the implementation address's own storage and balance, not the Registry-selected proxy's state; verified ABI equivalence does not repair target identity.",
